  // Implementation with full logging
}
```

## Don't Do
- Never put route-specific components in global `/components`
- Never make direct backend calls from API routes
- Never bypass the Redux API slice for requests
- Never skip comprehensive logging in any function
- Never create functions without proper error handling
- Never use direct fetch in components - use Redux
- Never mix route-specific code between different routes
- Never commit code without updating `PROJECT_WORKFLOW.md`
- Never create functions without JSDoc documentation
- Never ignore error context in debugging logs
- Never use generic error messages - always be specific about the source